.TH INIT_MODULE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
init_module \- loads a kernel module from an in-memory image; requires cap_sys_module and may be disabled
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/module.h>
.B int init_module(const void* image, unsigned long length, const char* parameters);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Loads a kernel module from an in-memory image; requires CAP_SYS_MODULE and may be disabled.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR init_module (2)
